            <ArticleTitle>[Psychological nursing after cleft lip and palate surgery with precardium area pain: a case report].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>221-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 18-year-old female patient after cleft lip and palate surgery with an uncommon complication-precardium area pain were reported. The psychological treatment and nursing along with routine clinical treatment to the patient were applied. The patient had recovered from the precardium area pain after one week treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
